## SALVO OUT, ECM IN

> For whatever reason @Salvo disbanded his team. This means @Diktator Kitkat | ECM CEO and Elite Carbon Motorsport have expanded to Formula 3!

@News and Media Ping

## FORZA LAMBO
> @Zak | Lambo CEO has returned to his CEO role, this time creating another Italian team, this time in @Lamborghini Motorsport [🇮🇹] 

@News and Media Ping

## APX OUT
> Due to driver complications, @seo | APXGP Executive Officer and APXGP have stepped out of the sport, and will attempt to rejoin VMS in Season 3

@News and Media Ping

## ECM JOINS F2
After a surprise application from @Diktator Kitkat | ECM CEO, the Italian based team of @Elite Carbon Motorsports F2 [🇮🇹] has succeeded Minardi F2, with all team slots now full!

@News and Media Ping

## NISSAN REPLACES MINARDI F1

> @Ford | Nissan CEO now has a team in every VMS series, with @Nissan Nismo F1 [🇩🇪] replaced Ducati Minardi

@News and Media Ping

## MINARDI F3 REPLACEMENT FOUND

> After talks of who would replace the Ducati Minardi F1, F2, and F3 team, @Altin | Kogun CEO has agreed to take over the later, with  @Kogun Technologies F3 Team [🇯🇵] rejoining the F3 grid, a team which managed to score points in their debut season!

@News and Media Ping

## LM ANNOUNCE NEW LOGO
> With LM Performance winning the WDC and WCC titles in F2 and F3 during Season 1, they have added 2 stars onto their logo, similar to how they do it in football

@News and Media Ping

## @Nissan Nismo F1 [🇩🇪] GONE, WITH NOT A SINGLE RED LIGHT GOING OUT

> Maldonado must have crumbled under the pressure of being a CEO, as he leaves abruptly with no drivers sign in F1, F2 or F3! Replacements have been chosen and should be announced soon

@News and Media Ping

## REBRAND 2, FROM THE SAME TEAM

> Due to roblox issues not allowing the logo to be uploaded, **Lotus Racing F2 & F3** has rebranded to @Lotus Ford Apex Racing F2 [🇬🇧] and @Lotus Ford Apex Racing F3 [🇬🇧] , bringing back the Apex to the team

@News and Media Ping

## Already a rebrand lol

> For Season 2, @Flekzy | Lotus Team Owner has decided to change from Ford Apex to **Lotus Racing Team** F2 & F3, bringing back a classic team from the 2010s, and a team which had @Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91 drive in it during Season 0!

@News and Media Ping

## @unknown-role ARE YOUR @VMS F1 World Constructors Champion S1 
##  @Piko | 🇪🇸 | 53 IS YOUR @VMS F3 World Drivers Champion S1 

@News and Media Ping

# SO CLOSE BUT SO FAR
@Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91 , the reigning World  Champion, sacked by @unknown-role  and shortly after signed by @unknown-role , who were at the time, trailing the scarlet red of @unknown-role  by 4 points in the F1 standings with just 2 rounds to go.
@Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91  went on to become a F2 WDC contender, but wasnt able to make the trophy his. After the conclusion of the most previous edition F2 season, @Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91 went on to make his debut in the first round of F1, quitting before round 2 ever came round.

# FAMILY REUNION
After being signed by @unknown-role  @Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91  replaced @Peters | 🇨🇱 | 19 , who was then signed by his roots in VMS, @unknown-role . The same very team he raced for in F3.

